venn.js
-------

venn.js 2.0.0 (https://github.com/upsetjs/venn.js): the area-proportional circle layout
(`venn`, the greedy and constrained MDS starts, `addMissingAreas`, `lossFunction`), the circle
intersection areas, `normalizeSolution`, `scaleSolution`, `computeTextCentres` and
`intersectionAreaPath`, and the optimisers it bundles from fmin (below).

  src/solver/circles.ts
  src/solver/fmin.ts
  src/solver/index.ts
  src/solver/normalize.ts
  src/solver/regions.ts
  src/solver/solve.ts

